# Start: turns_school_training's input.sav verbatim (France, Spring 1600, turn 108; England at peace,
# the Europe-bound Caravel held at sea, French units fortified, Quebec Schoolhouse + teacher).
# Covers: turn 109's King tax raise (@KINGTAX, +1% to 27%) accepted through @TAXOPTIONS row 0
# ("Kiss pinky ring."): the tax rate rises to 27%, no @TEAPARTY, no boycott, Quebec keeps its Tobacco.
# Everything else as turns_king_tax_tea_party / turns_school_training (Fisherman graduates).
key space                  # end turn 108
wait 30
key Return                 # Help: Time Scale (two turns per year from 1600)
wait 10
